section.subsection:
Each member of the commission:

shall have significant tax experience that is relevant to holding office as a commissioner;
shall have knowledge of tax administration or tax compliance;
shall have executive and administrative experience; and
except for one member who has substantial knowledge and expertise in the theory and practice of ad valorem taxation as described in Subsection (2)(a), shall have substantial knowledge and experience in one or more of the following:
the theory and practice of excise taxation;
the theory and practice of income taxation;
the theory and practice of sales and use taxation; and
the theory and practice of corporate taxation.
